🛑 What you cannot do (copyright line)
You cannot:

rip Code Vein meshes

rip Code Vein textures

rip Code Vein animations

rip Code Vein models

rip Code Vein sound files

rip Code Vein level geometry

These are copyrighted assets.

✅ What you can do (legal + common practice)
You can:

recreate the layout from scratch

recreate the architecture using Fallout 4 assets

recreate the “feel” or “theme”

replace Code Vein props with Fallout props

replace Mistle with a fast‑travel activator

